  "description": "An international organization founded in 1945 to maintain international peace and security, develop friendly relations among nations, and promote social progress, better living standards, and human rights. The meme falsely attributes a sinister role to the UN by suggesting it is 'adding' to the Holocaust death toll, which is a misrepresentation of the UN's function and historical role in acknowledging and commemorating the Holocaust.",
